title: mira_vesser_RepeatGreet
tags: repeat_greeting,npc:mira_vesser
---
// Repeat-greeting variants keyed on visited_count("mira_vesser_RepeatGreet").
<<if visited_count("mira_vesser_RepeatGreet") == 0>>
    Mira Vesser: Table's empty. Drink, or just passing through?
<<elseif visited_count("mira_vesser_RepeatGreet") == 1>>
    Mira Vesser: Seen you before. What'll it be?
<<elseif visited_count("mira_vesser_RepeatGreet") == 2>>
    Mira Vesser: You're getting comfortable in deep's walls. What's need?
<<else>>
    Mira Vesser: Don't bother with a menu; you know what you like.
<<endif>>
